    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 55 Anglers Walk, a charming three-bedroom semi-detached home in a mature, well-established development, just a short stroll from Carlow town centre and Fairgreen Shopping Centre. Enjoying a quiet setting with a large green area to the front, this appealing property combines everyday convenience with a relaxed residential atmosphere. \nThe bright, well-proportioned accommodation provides a practical layout for everyday living. To the rear, the spacious sitting room features an open fireplace, offering a welcoming focal point for cosy evenings, with sliding patio doors connecting the room to the garden. A modern kitchen, separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor.\nUpstairs are three generous bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom. Gas-fired central heating serves the home.\nOutside, a front lawn and driveway complement the attractive façade, while the south-west facing rear garden is a particularly appealing feature. With a lawn, paved patio and timber shed, it offers space to relax, enjoy outdoor dining or add your own planting and personal touches.\nWith shops, schools and local amenities close at hand, No. 55 offers an appealing balance of comfort, convenience and outdoor space. An excellent opportunity for first-time buyers or anyone seeking a well-located home within an established neighbourhood."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 0.97m (3'2\") x 5.48m (18'0\")\n\nKitchen - 3.09m (10'2\") x 3.77m (12'4\")\n\nUtility Room - 3.09m (10'2\") x 1.56m (5'1\")\n\nSitting Room - 5.06m (16'7\") x 3.89m (12'9\")\n\nWC - 0.76m (2'6\") x 1.93m (6'4\")\n\nLanding - 2.03m (6'8\") x 1.54m (5'1\")\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.52m (14'10\") x 2.94m (9'8\")\n\nEnsuite - 2.92m (9'7\") x 0.8m (2'7\")\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.49m (8'2\") x 3.75m (12'4\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.44m (8'0\") x 2.72m (8'11\")\n\nBathroom - 2.88m (9'5\") x 1.66m (5'5\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
